<figure class="architecture-diagram"><div class="diagram-head"><h3>PlayKit’s connection architecture</h3><span>One host, one connection per guest</span></div><div class="diagram-canvas" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable architecture diagram" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="playkit-architecture-title playkit-architecture-desc"><title id="playkit-architecture-title">Signaling and game data take different paths</title><desc id="playkit-architecture-desc">The host and guest exchange SDP offers, answers, and ICE candidates through a Cloudflare Worker and room Durable Object over WebSockets. Both use STUN to discover public address candidates. ICE checks possible paths. An encrypted WebRTC data channel carries game actions and snapshots directly between host and guest. A dashed TURN relay is an optional extension, currently disabled. Numbered markers match the five connection steps listed after the diagram.</desc><defs><marker id="playkit-architecture-blue" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10" fill="#315f91"/></marker><marker id="playkit-architecture-green" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10" fill="#527544"/></marker></defs>
<g ><rect class="node" x="205" y="12" width="230" height="70" rx="10"/><text x="320" y="39" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare signaling</text><text class="small" x="320" y="60" text-anchor="middle">Worker + room Durable Object</text><path class="signal" d="M95 155V48H195" marker-end="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)" marker-start="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)"/><path class="signal" d="M445 48H545V155" marker-end="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)" marker-start="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)"/><text class="small" x="95" y="106" text-anchor="middle">WebSocket</text><text class="small" x="545" y="106" text-anchor="middle">WebSocket</text><text x="320" y="111" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#315f91">Offer / answer / ICE candidates</text></g>
<rect class="node" x="20" y="165" width="150" height="64" rx="10"/><text x="95" y="190" text-anchor="middle">Host browser</text><text class="small" x="95" y="211" text-anchor="middle">Owns the game state</text><rect class="node" x="470" y="165" width="150" height="64" rx="10"/><text x="545" y="190" text-anchor="middle">Guest phone</text><text class="small" x="545" y="211" text-anchor="middle">Sends approved actions</text>
<g ><path class="data" d="M183 198H457" marker-end="url(#playkit-architecture-green)" marker-start="url(#playkit-architecture-green)"/><text x="320" y="174" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#527544">Encrypted data channel</text><text class="small" x="320" y="225" text-anchor="middle">Actions / authoritative snapshots</text></g>
<g ><rect class="node" x="230" y="267" width="180" height="46" rx="8"/><text x="320" y="295" text-anchor="middle">STUN discovery</text><path class="signal" d="M95 241V289H220" marker-end="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)" marker-start="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)"/><path class="signal" d="M420 289H545V241" marker-end="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)" marker-start="url(#playkit-architecture-blue)"/></g>
